{"id":10000022,"name":"温迪","enName":"Venti","title":"风色诗人","element":"风","region":"蒙德","rarity":5,"weapon":"弓","birthday":"6月16日","constellation":"歌仙座","description":"蒙德城诸多吟游诗人中的一位，自由自在地穿行在街头巷尾。","affiliation":"蒙德城","cv":{"chinese":"喵酱","japanese":"村濑步","english":"艾丽卡·哈拉彻","korean":"郑侑廷"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000022-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000022-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Venti.zip","voicePackageEn":"Venti","quoteCount":73,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"哈…睡得好香呀。欸，你好呀，旅行者，我们又见面了。嗯？不记得我了？嘿嘿，那就让我再次加入你的旅程吧。你的诗篇，值得被我这个世上最好的吟游诗人传唱！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/00ax2qytvbg49rhhcfzgtebz4kfv8a3.ogg"},{"title":"闲聊·弹琴","desc":"嗯…想接着听下去的话，送我一个苹果吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_explore_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/crvqa7vg3f8tqydocp0v5l3uinztxb4.ogg"},{"title":"闲聊·苹果酒","desc":"嗯…好想坐在大树上，手边有喝不完的苹果酒。哎。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_explore_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d2/tqfei43uwnuegx9wjnu06tl2ssn8qwe.ogg"},{"title":"闲聊·诗篇","desc":"动身吧，旅行者。佚失的诗篇，还在等着我们呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_explore_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/be/qq6fxszuhs8m7qhve7pz2pljhvq3p0g.ogg"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"来踩小水坑吧！看看谁溅出来的水花更大！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/oguh1tfbsdfgueuseesdow5vlw2vn96.ogg"},{"title":"雨过天晴…","desc":"欸~这就天晴了？我还想多玩一会儿呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_weather_afterRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/j0nni301crnzkra7zfc43km05zflcyu.ogg"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"等雪积起来…我们来打雪仗吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1a/3i8o1hkrna017kvtgnm6l37hi3qflfa.ogg"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"难得呀，要不要去飞一飞？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ea/3wdcw44mfj36oyrgpiw33zxbll0skuf.ogg"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早，准备开始新的冒险了么？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/gneimtxg5crpqj6pm94xrnsstevrutj.ogg"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"咕…肚子饿了，又不敢再去晨曦酒庄蹭饭…啊，是你呀！欸嘿，要出门么？带我一个呗。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/f1esalabrfdtgteiqw6kv8idveb2ine.ogg"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"我还不困哦。要我陪你走走么？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/1sa0983ksqy89nrgnvl6hhiogirxc0c.ogg"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"欸？要休息了吗？嘿嘿，晚安。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/6zzhq82nhv0yx8icbaqya04roqqz43m.ogg"},{"title":"关于温迪自己…","desc":"练习？哼哼，我当然不需要啦，在这提瓦特就没有我不会唱的歌。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/ihbl5p9d5wcmvqroivop67aahc0qxm2.ogg"},{"title":"关于我们·新歌","desc":"我想把你写进新歌里！欸，怎么露出这种表情呀，担心付不起稿费吗？哈哈，摩拉就不要了，不如…跟我再讲讲你的故事吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/lmuocihly0oz9rr62i4hvf12ywspmhl.ogg"},{"title":"关于我们·勇者","desc":"唔…嗯！嘿嘿，等到勇者救出了{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYD|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLD]}，我会第一时间让全大陆传唱这首歌谣。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_close2_heroine","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/10/lexx6fvt46uz1u9wz0cd991cy0xsd8o.ogg"},{"title":"关于我们·使徒","desc":"夜风凉爽，是适合成为神的使徒的天气！那么事不宜迟，快来向我献上供奉吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_close3","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/o0ygryfj1vlpa2h2lui6hur24oq94q1.ogg"},{"title":"关于我们·请求","desc":"欸，要风神我更加努力一点？那你是不是也要展示点诚意呢。比如虔诚、热爱，或者说…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_close4","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/79/li9c7z34csh9av92rwjyoygg31adg6a.ogg"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"欸？好奇我的「神之眼」？喔…喏，给你。喜欢的话…要我给你做一个一样的么？嘿嘿嘿。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/ksn7e5v4yvov0k2fe7pj3kg75hwzzuf.ogg"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"Olah！嘿嘿，这是丘丘人打招呼用的话哦。问我学这个干嘛？哎呀，为了创作，知识面当然越广越好啊。唔，好像，我还没尝试过用丘丘语写歌呢…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_share","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b1/a3k64u9lus3ifzqekqmnzovvjziynrl.ogg"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"旅行者，你见过塞西莉亚花么？那是一种只在安静的山崖顶上默默绽放的白色野花。在我心里，它就是全提瓦特最美的花。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2b/6f77049qajh8kl6oa67sg6d5yonroim.ogg"},{"title":"关于琴…","desc":"骑士团代理团长大人…你觉得她是个怎样的人？嘿嘿，跟我想得一样。认真，勇敢，也不乏温柔。和我一个朋友有点像呢…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_qin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/8nfc8gylmr1jautj02igj97nn46j815.ogg"},{"title":"关于迪卢克…","desc":"去跟迪卢克老爷处好关系吧？你想，他家可是有好~多~珍藏的酒啊！嘿嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿嘿…咦，无论如何不准喝酒么？那…就去闻一闻吧，闻一闻！只是闻的话，你也可以喔。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_diluc_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/f9afbbg4inoau3d3qap3bfzexr0r9pi.ogg"},{"title":"关于芭芭拉…","desc":"唱歌很好听的牧师女孩儿，你认识么、你认识么？…唔，偶像？…啊，握手会？…嗯，专场live？…这样啊，音乐还真是深奥呐。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_barbara_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/37/4cphz4klirqqhmu8pyodyea65ykhpnh.ogg"},{"title":"关于雷泽…","desc":"那个奔狼领的白发少年，哦哦，是吗，是被狼养大的啊…怪不得呢，他身上的气息，令人怀念…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_razor_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/22/qjrceaumngv5v9zab642eptapw9pz3i.ogg"},{"title":"关于莫娜…","desc":"啊，那位占星术士吗？这么说吧，占卜和我的诗歌一样，都是让人穷到酒钱都凑不齐的没用技术呢！欸？你说占星至少是一项文化传统，所以不是没用的？呜，真失礼啊，那诗歌也一样有用啊！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_mona_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b3/m8g4bmcqkkehum01cmx1yn3smnd79v0.ogg"},{"title":"关于迪奥娜…","desc":"远近闻名的猫尾酒馆特调酒。可是…呜，会，打，打喷嚏。要不，你帮我讨一杯酒来吧。我肯定会好好感激你的，一言为定。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_diona_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/gva1u9pb0zjxvpbdvrl5uivq7hrziw2.ogg"},{"title":"关于阿贝多…","desc":"黑土与白垩、宇宙与地层，无垢之土创生原初之人…特征实在太明显了，难以忽视呀。这么危险的古老技术，万一在城里失控——嗨，算了，就让蒙德人自己解决蒙德的问题吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_albedo_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/t19ask5t11h4mr13rzbphrjdt3drt2l.ogg"},{"title":"关于摩拉克斯…","desc":"你见过那位老爷子了？他近来还好吗？欸，变成名叫「钟离」的普通人了？对他那个死脑筋而言，这应该是不小的改变啊。啊，陪我去见见他吧，带上这瓶埋在风起地的陈年好酒当作慰问品。啊对了，他现在还强不强，实力还剩几成啊？我这样过去，应该不会被打飞吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_morax_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/dssiac1la863v2gnqp4u3o20mfiv37g.ogg"},{"title":"关于优菈…","desc":"优菈对酒的品位可是很不错的。无论夏天、冬天都要喝冰的这一点，在现在的蒙德人里也算难得啦。感觉能和她成为不错的酒友。嗯？你说我编排的劳伦斯家的歌…早已经传到了她的耳朵里？哈，那有什么关系嘛？说不定，我们还能一起唱呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_eula_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/q39fq1u77coogjbrojz20iud2j0zdtf.mp3"},{"title":"关于巴尔…","desc":"听说，你把那位不可一世的雷电将军也击败了？啊…想当年她作为影武者的时候，就在追求极致的武技了。如今，也一定会借用各种各样的理由叫你做陪练吧。嗯嗯，偷偷告诉你她的弱点吧，耳朵凑过来——是「甜点心」哦！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_baal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ae/osg9qhx0a2o46iy370jokh7a3x4xni0.mp3"},{"title":"关于布耶尔…","desc":"你说草神啊，说到草神，就会先想到她那关于「梦境」的权能吧？与我所作的那些诗歌一样，她所创造的梦境也一样充满了浪漫与想象，我们可是很合得来呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_nahida_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/f099g9mdgjqghoqgmnhyw2p2ly8wd3y.mp3"},{"title":"关于芙宁娜…","desc":"吟游诗人所擅长的，多是弹奏与演唱，可一位戏剧表演者所需要具备的能力，还远远不止这些…下次风花节把芙宁娜请过来一起表演怎么样？嗯？你想让我聊聊她拯救枫丹的事？有这样艺术才华的人就算拯救了整个世界，也毫不奇怪吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_teammate_furina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/qvz4gdft7fyrttktzk4rvxztfneh14a.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解温迪·其一","desc":"来得正好，旅行者。我想听听，你的愿望是什么？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/09/d7lg1x2fp56n3e8n988i60vuk5m8m7c.ogg"},{"title":"想要了解温迪·其二","desc":"跟你一起旅行真是件有趣的事，要说美中不足就是你身边的那只小不点了吧。那么能吃，你们的伙食费很了不得吧？哈哈。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/mi0qh8wrurjxemsbkugmphrxrq34a7j.ogg"},{"title":"想要了解温迪·其三","desc":"火之神是个横行霸道的战斗狂，岩之神是个不懂人心的死脑筋。问我怎么会知道这些？欸嘿，叙事诗里都写得一清二楚嘛，他们的故事。那个年代的故事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/84edd0apk52goqn34ch369qocc19pwy.ogg"},{"title":"想要了解温迪·其四","desc":"天空岛啊。连我也不一定飞得到那里呢。而且在那里，没有甜的水，也长不出什么好吃的果子。就更不会有好酒咯？嘿嘿，所以请我去我都不想去哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/60/1vanur4a46ljyyo3hycvktykvs8muur.ogg"},{"title":"想要了解温迪·其五","desc":"我的愿望？嗯。以前，我想着要游历整个世界。现在也一样，不过嘛，加上了一份限定条件，那就是跟你一起。有你在，才是完整的。记叙者果然要和冒险者在一起才行嘛，嘿嘿！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/f79o23zzsx1gsv1k1y2qn2a54w97bss.ogg"},{"title":"温迪的爱好…","desc":"我喜欢酒！还有风！唔，如果能有用风酿的酒就好了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/54/5p7mrnoxszc2yruh7yal1uqfq8ma7ta.ogg"},{"title":"温迪的烦恼…","desc":"其实，只要有猫在附近，我就忍不住会打喷嚏…啊-啊-阿嚏！唔…哎呀…就连想一想也不行么…欸，你知不知道该怎么治好这个毛病呀？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/ha5kzm1dw7l42s2jhq6wffwuug8qyra.ogg"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"你也来一个苹果吗，刚摘的。啊呜，啊…又脆又甜，苹果才是神的馈赠吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/k8vs4d6u33didebc4yxroxjp5jetbyu.ogg"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"哎，你在做什么好吃的吗？欸？热奶酪饼！这个…这个不行，热热的黏糊糊的，唔…对我来说，太腻了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0d/l8lr7iiop64mitwj524crvsefcn1bmy.ogg"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"啊，好满足！明天也会有吧？后天也会有吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/j3aiuo89ol5pctzuix8t3tfd0r0gssd.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"呼，好饱，连餐后水果都要吃不下了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9c/c1aectv1vdjycuki3inpa6m9va2e3bu.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"竟然是连我都应付不来的食物。唔…这下可难办了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/g8jhuixaq1c4s46ctzg24p8w137qzxv.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"我以前听朋友说生日是要吃蛋糕的…喏，苹果蛋糕，给，勺子。烤出来的时候有点塌了，所以看上去像是苹果派。欸嘿，甜点还真是复杂呀。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ca/ciurw6dsnpis1559xguyq5fijjcmnhw.ogg"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"欸！刚刚发生了什么！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/fdkltv02b5ziwjgvxch4rvkndxzy7a1.ogg"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"辛苦啦。想要来点音乐放松一下吗？随想曲，还是小夜曲？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/pltnl1bo9gd81h1n3avykig1sxnq6vp.ogg"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"来，坐这边。我写了一首新诗哦，就叫它「旅行者之风」吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b3/alhkl4o8xeb8gr27ornughx4n3w9wrc.ogg"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"唔…明明这些风景早就看过很多遍了，有你在身边，却像是呈现出了不同的样子。你该不会…还藏着一大堆奇奇怪怪的能力吧？…唔，那倒也不错。说明，我看人的眼光很准呀，欸嘿。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_venti/vo_venti_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/97ihrerwhyk6308g95lktsnsgbr2ths.ogg"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"哟呼——","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/ihvvvequ02uraktiyisyfp0ic76oic0.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"在这哟。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/be/forqplbnhmvkia6hbc2q2tf2itjtxik.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"留意脚下。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/m2gveam0164nmm4kznuon54s173mh86.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"一起来玩吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/1ryq0y3467ltwggtp89eregs03qtelm.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"别想逃开喔？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/pfl6lgj92yyge9ybs8388w7pml0lf7b.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"起风咯~","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/84/1lvpus84bg4cc3cxa3gmir7iyue57co.mp3"},{"title":"冲刺开始·其一","desc":"飞，比跑快吧？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_explore_sprint_start_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/81/rdymm5sl6b37r06r8l4vtpru55bnwql.mp3"},{"title":"打开风之翼·其一","desc":"呀嘿~","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_explore_fly_start_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/tphfcdnt4t1on3kc4dxaghoc24vegu2.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"咳咳，请听一首，「宝箱之歌」！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2f/bsrykjhcvrgzmqde3faekzqa28nfnt6.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"嘿嘿，要不要感谢「风神的眷顾」呀？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/bw5qbnqske81565t77p4lzc3qywvy14.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"收获不少，可以拿去换几瓶好酒啦。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/oxa2po3xv66wc0ynrsuqf2i3lfjrwj9.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"等等，这可不好玩！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/49lzsz2q3fmelus8dkrm27xy3syyo7k.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"哎呀，别盯着我打呀。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a1/r7kdhyo2qghrncysruprhcg3h9ss6pk.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"好过分呐。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/ikc90p8da3szgiq1brj82i3pk3ics4f.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"交给我吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a7/5mgfo7f05u51m9xvfzafrw42mwjobyx.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"还不能放弃哦。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/3yf77o2iv5z0m4mov1dg8236tb8rj31.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"稍微睡一下吧…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/m8myqo08092jojck9hudz70z41fz3np.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"啊呀，弦断了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/fbiah450q3whkk1c0tmae8jkx9f7b9g.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"扑通。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/5zgwfypoadxt6coafjdw0lkf0fzxy05.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"哎呀…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d2/6ny9mrd3p2bitdh711tsv6nmrclqlu6.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"好粗鲁哦。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_venti/vo_venti_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e5/7grah9kjlwnz4z6owtu0i4tclpu1fdx.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"调音完成。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_venti_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b8/fscuyigcb2o3od52oyb6v1pe5xg8e6s.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"让你久等了哦？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_venti_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/5wrn06dzorjm7q0rq3u6zmrsrs1hnde.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"是要做热身运动吗。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_venti_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/p877yotebbxus0aywsq875fch6kixb9.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000022-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000022-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1061,"fullArtHeight":962}